### Lion 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/members/lions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "이영희",
  "major": "컴퓨터공학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "백엔드",
  "studentId": "20230002"
}

### Staff 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/members/staffs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "박민수",
  "major": "소프트웨어학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "백엔드",
  "position": "부대표"
}

### 멤버 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/members/이영희

### Lion 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/members/lions/이영희
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "major": "정보통신공학과",
  "generation": 13,
  "part": "프론트엔드",
  "studentId": "20230001"
}

### 멤버 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/members/이영희